# included in MedveModem (GPL-3.0-only) unchanged in content, comments
# translated. See NOTICE.
#
# Format: <kind>:<pattern>:<apn>
#   plmn:<mcc>-<mnc>:<apn>  the SIM's home network (most exact; before the database)
#   name:<substring>:<apn>  a substring of the SIM's operator name, lower case
#                           (last resort, after the database)
